From eecab3bcef907260ecbe83794fbab4c79e74f3ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Floyd <git@notmy.space>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 05:05:11 +0000
Subject: ipa: soft: agc: Select the luma and histogram targets by lux index

The tuning's AEC luma target falls from 54 to 34 over the dark zones of
the rear camera, and its histogram limits differ by zone. Read
meanTargetLux and histogramLux, and blend the zones around the lux index
of the frame before, as the other algorithms do for their data.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
